        <item>
            <title>0.58</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 15:20:01 +0200</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>202610081517</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.58</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>A teammate's workers stay through a short network drop, and a branch named for another repository's issue is no issue here</li>
<li>Flat floor marks and a room's furniture no longer block the hallway beside it</li>
<li>Walk the station at eye height, or ride along behind a minion on a crane</li>
<li>A session archived in a checkout of its own takes its office with it</li>
<li>An office with its lights off keeps its repository's colour in a rim, and borders stop at doorways</li>
<li>Offices can open beside their own repository, and a station alone lays them out afresh</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
